!!omap
  - id: F040
  - function: ReadReservationInfo
  - range:
      - 753
      - 788
  - args:
      - ReservationPtr ReservationList
      - ReservationPtr *ReservationInfo
      - UserPtr UserList
      - RoomPtr *RoomList
  - return: void
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "void ReadReservationInfo(ReservationPtr ReservationList, ReservationPtr
      *ReservationInfo, UserPtr UserList, RoomPtr *RoomList)\n{\n  printf(\"\\nEnter
      Reservation Info:\\n--------------------------\");\n\n  printf(\"\\n - ID: \"\
      );\n  (*ReservationInfo)->ID = ReadIntBetween(0, 9999);\n  while (SearchReservationByID(ReservationList,
      (*ReservationInfo)->ID) != NULL)\n  {\n    printf(\"\\nReservation with ID [%d]
      already exist!\", (*ReservationInfo)->ID);\n    printf(\"\\n - Please enter
      another ID: \");\n    (*ReservationInfo)->ID = ReadIntBetween(0, 9999);\n  }\n\
      \n  printf(\"\\n - User ID: \");\n  (*ReservationInfo)->UserID = ReadIntBetween(0,
      9999);\n  while (SearchUserByID(UserList, (*ReservationInfo)->UserID) == NULL)\n\
      \  {\n    printf(\"\\nUser with ID [%d] not found!\", (*ReservationInfo)->UserID);\n\
      \    printf(\"\\n - Please enter a valid User ID: \");\n    (*ReservationInfo)->UserID
      = ReadIntBetween(0, 9999);\n  }\n\n  RoomPtr Room;\n  printf(\"\\n - Room ID:
      \");\n  (*ReservationInfo)->RoomID = ReadIntBetween(0, 9999);\n  while ((Room
      = SearchRoomByID(*RoomList, (*ReservationInfo)->RoomID)) == NULL || Room->IsReserved
      == true)\n  {\n    printf(\"\\nRoom with ID [%d] not available!\", (*ReservationInfo)->RoomID);\n\
      \    printf(\"\\n - Please enter another Room ID: \");\n    (*ReservationInfo)->RoomID
      = ReadIntBetween(0, 9999);\n  }\n\n  ReadReservationPeriod(ReservationInfo,
      &Room);\n\n  (*ReservationInfo)->Next = NULL;\n}\n"
  - description: 
      この関数は、予約情報を入力し、既存の予約やユーザー、部屋の情報と照合して新しい予約を作成するためのもので、重複する予約IDや無効なユーザーID、予約済みの部屋が選択されないように入力をチェックします。
